            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46722",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Instance properties</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">At the moment the documentation recommends the deprecated algorithms EdDSA (-8), and ES256 (-7):</p>\n<blockquote>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034220-f8fc6564-e5e1-4e36-815b-052511c3a127.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KN56Q2VID-oEpW2GI7OIYxOftuPEa0IHsfW6pQXly4g\"><img width=\"745\" height=\"286\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034220-f8fc6564-e5e1-4e36-815b-052511c3a127.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KN56Q2VID-oEpW2GI7OIYxOftuPEa0IHsfW6pQXly4g\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 286px;; aspect-ratio: 745 / 286; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The problem is that these algorithms EdDSA (-8), and ES256 (-7) are deprecated by the authority (COSE):</p>\n<blockquote>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034741-ad3050d7-6d1f-4559-9767-e113dbfdcec6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..F2qZ5wIKZCDwAykrgUFCD3o9v37UgaT6u8VW_mMrSbQ\"><img width=\"1426\" height=\"43\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034741-ad3050d7-6d1f-4559-9767-e113dbfdcec6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..F2qZ5wIKZCDwAykrgUFCD3o9v37UgaT6u8VW_mMrSbQ\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 43px;; aspect-ratio: 1426 / 43; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.iana.org/assignments/cose#algorithms\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.iana.org/assignments/cose#algorithms</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We should probably just remove these lines:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/51f9f1329e9d05233d39daaa9d5e4f89d77e57b5/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md?plain=1#L125\">content/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 125\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/mdn/content/commit/51f9f1329e9d05233d39daaa9d5e4f89d77e57b5\">51f9f13</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L125\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"125\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC125\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-v\">-</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">-8</span><span class=\"pl-s\">`</span>: EdDSA </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/51f9f1329e9d05233d39daaa9d5e4f89d77e57b5/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md?plain=1#L126\">content/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 126\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/mdn/content/commit/51f9f1329e9d05233d39daaa9d5e4f89d77e57b5\">51f9f13</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L126\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"126\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC126\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-v\">-</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">-7</span><span class=\"pl-s\">`</span>: ES256 </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">P.S. I'm not aware how the market is replacing these... so I believe we should just remove these from the doc. Thanks for your thoughts!</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN metadata</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Page report details</summary>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Folder: <code class=\"notranslate\">en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions</code></li>\n<li>MDN URL: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions</a></li>\n<li>GitHub URL: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md</a></li>\n<li>Last commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/a4c63d2855b2f557e7d1ee821dee65011d569a41/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/a4c63d2855b2f557e7d1ee821dee65011d569a41\"><tt>a4c63d2</tt></a></li>\n<li>Document last modified: 2026-09-17T10:37:31.000Z</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
